upgrade:
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2025.6.0"
    component:
      - trigger: cs_initiator
        description: >
          In sisdk-2025.6.0 the cs_initiator component was significantly changed along with its public API. The automated upgrade is not possible, it has to be carried out manually. The recommended way to upgrade your project using this component is to create a new project from sisdk-2025.6.0 and migrate your changes (e.g. application logic) on top of that.
        status: impossible
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2026.6.0"
    component:
      - script: bluetooth_le_middleware/component/upgrade_component_cs_ncp.lua
        description: >
          In Simplicity SDK 2025.12 and earlier, bt_cs_ncp used iostream_dummy to prevent the
          board component from adding a VCOM IO Stream transport, because the NCP already used
          VCOM through UARTDRV. Since the default NCP transport now uses IO Stream instead of
          UARTDRV, this workaround is no longer needed and the board component can recommend the
          required VCOM IO Stream instance.
